Crates
======

Every Rust crate in the build graph of upstream's librashader.dylib
(librashader-capi with its default features, runtime-all, for
aarch64-apple-darwin and x86_64-apple-darwin; its Cargo.lock at the v0.12.0
tag), grouped by licence text. Some of them (the Direct3D runtimes,
d3d12-descriptor-heap, the windows-* crates) only build on Windows; the
graph does not gate them by target, so they are listed too. Where a crate offers a choice, the first one in the accepted list of
xboxrecomp's third_party/librashader/about.toml is used.
